                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "spans": [
                    {
                      "text": "The actual implementation depends on the particular CPU. This instruction",
                      "style": "Plain"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " ",
                      "style": "Plain"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "is considered a hint, so the CPU is also free to simply ignore the request.",
                      "style": "Plain"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "spans": [
                    {
                      "text": "The amount of prefetched data depends on the cache line size of the",
                      "style": "Plain"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " ",
                      "style": "Plain"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "specific CPU, but it will be at least 32 bytes.",
                      "style": "Plain"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "spans": [
                    {
                      "text": "Common caveats:",
                      "style": "Plain"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "spans": [
                            {
                              "text": "Most modern CPUs already automatically prefetch data based on predicted",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            },
                            {
                              "text": " ",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "access patterns.",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "spans": [
                            {
                              "text": "Data is usually not fetched if this would cause a TLB miss or a page",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            },
                            {
                              "text": " ",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "fault.",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "spans": [
                            {
                              "text": "Too much prefetching can cause unnecessary cache evictions.",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "spans": [
                            {
                              "text": "Prefetching may also fail if there are not enough memory-subsystem",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            },
                            {
                              "text": " ",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "resources (e.g., request buffers).",
                              "style": "Plain"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "spans": [
                    {
                      "text": "Note: this intrinsic is safe to use even though it takes a raw pointer argument. In general, this",
                      "style": "Plain"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " ",
                      "style": "Plain"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "cannot change the behavior of the program, including not trapping on invalid pointers.",
                      "style": "Plain"
